From: Kundan Kumar <kundan.kumar@samsung.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 17:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] uvp: add interactive checkpoint holds and host actions

Add a bounded stdin control protocol for the UVP web coordinator. Permit a
configured host argv to run once during an owned QEMU hold, followed by
explicit release and the existing post-release guest action. Keep watchdog
recovery, pidfd signalling and the original gate checks. Isolate action
output from control stdout. Add an explicit no-BPF test build shim and an
overridable daemon path for the original regression scripts.

Signed-off-by: Kundan Kumar <kundan.kumar@samsung.com>
---
